[en.FOCUS_C07_LPGG]
Las Pegasus Gaming Group (LPGG)

[en.FOCUS_C07_LPGG_desc]
Gaming Group? Video games?\nNah, Casinos and Lottery! \nCasinos and Lottery?\nNah, just a cover for underground trade and smuggling.\nUnderground trade?\nNah, just a cover for recruiting underworld agents to exchange intelligence.\nUnderworld agents?\nNah, we’re just a gaming group. Come apply! (Safety insurance not included)

[zh.FOCUS_C07_LPGG]
洛马基娱乐集团 (LPGG)

[zh.FOCUS_C07_LPGG_desc]
娱乐集团？电子游戏？\n不，是赌场和彩票！\n赌场和彩票？\n不，只是地下交易和走私的幌子。\n地下交易？\n不，只是招募黑道特工交换情报的幌子。\n黑道特工？\n不，我们只是一个娱乐集团。来应聘吧！（不包括安全保险）

